<view class="page factory-page"><view class="factory-nav"><button bindtap="back">‹ 返回</button><view class="eyebrow">FACTORY ARCHIVE</view><button bindtap="copyId">ID</button></view><view class="factory-hero card-dark fade-in"><view class="factory-hero-top"><view><view class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">{{factory.code}}</view><view class="factory-name">{{factory.name}}</view><view class="factory-owner">{{factory.owner}}</view></view><status-orb state="running" label="SYNCED"></status-orb></view><view class="factory-summary">{{factory.summary}}</view><view class="factory-stat-row"><view><text>{{factory.floors}}</text><small>楼层</small></view><view><text>{{factory.objects}}</text><small>对象</small></view><view><text>{{factory.machines}}</text><small>设备</small></view><view><text>v{{factory.version}}</text><small>存档</small></view></view></view><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">楼层档案</view><view class="section-meta">{{factory.updated}}</view></view><view class="floor-list"><block wx:for="{{factory.floorsInfo}}" wx:key="name"><view class="floor-card card"><view class="floor-index">0{{index + 1}}</view><view class="floor-main"><view class="floor-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="floor-note">{{item.note}}</view><view class="floor-foot"><text><view class="status-dot status-dot-{{item.signal}}"></view>{{item.signal === 'warning' ? '需要关注' : '结构稳定'}}</text><text>{{item.objects}} 个对象</text></view></view><text class="floor-arrow">›</text></view></block></view><view class="boundary-card card"><view class="boundary-icon">!</view><view><view class="boundary-title">移动端的边界</view><view class="boundary-copy">这里展示结构摘要与运行信号。要编辑设备、碰撞、端口、寻路或应用 Agent 方案，请打开 ForgeMind Web 工作台。</view></view></view><button class="primary archive-button" bindtap="back">返回移动总览</button></view>

